# Managed Policy

`DATA_FORMULATOR_POLICY` or the platform default policy file overrides CLI
and UI settings. A missing optional file is fine. A present or explicit
file that cannot be parsed is a hard failure.

- `force_offline` must block LLM calls before any network attempt.
- Do not fail open on malformed JSON.
- Surface locked settings through `/api/app-config` `POLICY`.
